Scope and method
----------------
No third-party source code is vendored, bundled, or redistributed in this
repository. Every dependency below is declared by version and fetched at
install/build time from its public registry (PyPI or npm). This repository
contains no `vendor/`, `third-party/`, or checked-in `node_modules/` tree, and
no minified or pre-built third-party bundles.

The audit below was produced from:

  * backend/requirements.txt          resolved with `pip-licenses` over the
                                      full transitive closure (87 packages)
  * infrastructure/requirements.txt   2 direct packages
  * frontend/package-lock.json        `license` metadata for the full locked
                                      tree (536 packages; 335 of them are
                                      production/runtime, the rest build-time)

Result: every dependency is under a permissive, redistribution-friendly
