Reproducing this audit
----------------------
  # Backend
  python3 -m venv .venv-audit
  .venv-audit/bin/pip install pip-licenses -r backend/requirements.txt
  .venv-audit/bin/pip-licenses --format=markdown --with-urls --order=license

  # Frontend (no install required; reads locked license metadata)
  cd frontend && npm ls --all --json    # or inspect package-lock.json
